  "cover_text": "These Card Characters are a new range of LogoBugs that are tops and base for our well established Bobbug model characters. The Card characters come fully shadowed on the top with white wings on the leg and have planes, helmets, chains and other decorated features. They have a high dinosaur outline of the beak, hooked teeth, and spine. They have the proper colours and activity. Suit up brand new.All in All The Neat Eye cards are a special collection and will offer a fun and very unique experience for members to find such an interesting and challenging set of cards",
